boswas-sysops (1.0~alpha3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the Boswas OS privileged helper
    (/usr/libexec/boswas/sysops), started through pkexec with one polkit
    action per operation: APT refresh, upgrade, install, remove and local
    .deb installation, package cache and journal cleanup, the firmware
    report, approved Flatpak remotes and the Android runtime (Waydroid).
  * JSON Lines progress and results, cancellation while nothing has been
    changed, lock detection, protected and excluded packages.

 -- Boswas OS Platform Team <os-platform@boswas.invalid>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
